*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] (10%) spawns as the boss after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.
**2 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Use at least 3 meatshields ([[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]]/[[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Samba Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]] are good choices) and use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] alongside [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] or any decent [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]]/[[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] for offense.

Keep in mind that no [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]] or [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]] units can be deployed, however [[Cat Combo|Combos]] involving them still work.

==='''Chapters 2 & 3'''===
As this stage is nearly the same as it was in Chapter 1, the same strategies will work. Stall the initial LeMurr with meatshields to save up money, then send out all your heavy hitters at once and don't stop meatshielding. If 3-6 heavy hitters can't handle the Maawth and GreGories on their own, use [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and Macho Leg Cats as an additional means of attack.

