==Trivia==
*The planet [[wikipedia:Pluto|Pluto]] was named after the Roman god of the Underworld, [[wikipedia:Pluto (mythology)|Pluto]]. Hence, the [[Treasure]] of this stage is Darkness.
*Pluto's base is an abstract representation of [[wikipedia:Astro Boy|Astro Boy]]. The horned symbol on top is shaped like his head, the red objects on either side look like his boots, and the base itself has the same colors as his shorts and belt (gray and green respectively). This is most likely because Pluto is the name of a [[wikipedia:List of Astro Boy characters#Pluto|major antagonist]] in ''Astro Boy'' and ''[[wikipedia:Pluto: Urasawa x Tezuka|Pluto: Urasawa x Tezuka]]''.

